    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385570/extras/46eb2b9e52b3834742e43dc388576553.avif?t=1735329432\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span>Build your harem empire as the Squid King and corrupt the ladies to reveal their true nature. Every game in the &quot;Corrupt Them All&quot; series is interconnected, sharing progression in terms of upgrades and the main storyline.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will gain new abilities as you play, which will always help you progress faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Squid King, you will level up, allowing you to upgrade abilities and commit to specific strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, as you gain experience, your targets become corrupted. If you manage to corrupt them before your energy runs out, you advance to their next corruption stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each corruption stage reveals a glimpse of the target's lewd side and marks the beginning of their self-discovery as they join your harem.</p></li></ul>",
